                <span begin="02:01.715" end="02:02.096">words </span>
                <span begin="02:02.096" end="02:02.357">won't </span>
                <span begin="02:02.357" end="02:02.644">be </span>
                <span begin="02:02.644" end="02:03.933">enough</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">仅是这些誓言并不够</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="02:05.840" end="02:10.018" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">
                <span begin="02:05.840" end="02:05.882">And </span>
                <span begin="02:05.882" end="02:06.146">you </span>
                <span begin="02:06.146" end="02:06.394">won't </span>
                <span begin="02:06.394" end="02:06.630">need </span>
                <span begin="02:06.630" end="02:06.915">to </span>
                <span begin="02:06.915" end="02:07.363">know </span>
                <span begin="02:07.363" end="02:07.659">the </span>
                <span begin="02:07.659" end="02:08.271">names </span>
                <span begin="02:08.271" end="02:08.598">on </span>
                <span begin="02:08.598" end="02:08.870">our </span>
                <span begin="02:08.870" end="02:10.018">faces</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你无需牢记我们的脸孔 我们的名字</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="02:10.602" end="02:13.308" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">
                <span begin="02:10.602" end="02:10.858">But </span>
                <span begin="02:10.858" end="02:11.103">that'll </span>
                <span begin="02:11.103" end="02:11.709">carry </span>
                <span begin="02:11.709" end="02:12.172">on </span>
                <span begin="02:12.172" end="02:12.428">for </span>
                <span begin="02:12.428" end="02:13.308">us</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">尽管这会与我们一路相随</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="02:14.015" end="02:18.644" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">
                <span begin="02:14.015" end="02:14.447">And </span>
                <span begin="02:14.447" end="02:14.718">it's </span>
                <span begin="02:14.718" end="02:14.955">a </span>
                <span begin="02:14.955" end="02:15.218">long </span>
                <span begin="02:15.218" end="02:15.613">way </span>
                <span begin="02:15.613" end="02:17.010">forward </span>
                <span begin="02:17.010" end="02:17.290">so </span>
                <span begin="02:17.290" end="02:17.919">trust </span>
                <span begin="02:17.919" end="02:18.236">in </span>
                <span begin="02:18.236" end="02:18.644">me</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">尽管这是一段漫长的旅程 但请相信我</span>
            </p>
