                <span begin="02:19.622" end="02:19.924">I'll </span>
                <span begin="02:19.924" end="02:20.212">give </span>
                <span begin="02:20.212" end="02:20.516">the </span>
                <span begin="02:20.516" end="02:21.338">shelter </span>
                <span begin="02:21.338" end="02:21.785">like </span>
                <span begin="02:21.785" end="02:22.201">you've </span>
                <span begin="02:22.201" end="02:22.554">done </span>
                <span begin="02:22.554" end="02:22.835">for </span>
                <span begin="02:22.835" end="02:23.123">me</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我会给你安心的庇护之所 就像你为我所做的一样</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="02:23.658" end="02:29.513" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">
                <span begin="02:23.658" end="02:23.907">And </span>
                <span begin="02:23.907" end="02:24.131">I </span>
                <span begin="02:24.131" end="02:25.243">know </span>
                <span begin="02:25.243" end="02:25.492">I'm </span>
                <span begin="02:25.492" end="02:26.235">not </span>
                <span begin="02:26.235" end="02:27.544">alone </span>
                <span begin="02:27.544" end="02:27.789">you'll </span>
                <span begin="02:27.789" end="02:28.037">be </span>
                <span begin="02:28.037" end="02:28.420">watching </span>
                <span begin="02:28.420" end="02:29.100">over </span>
                <span begin="02:29.100" end="02:29.513">us</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我知道我并不孤独 你会一直守护我</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="02:29.956" end="02:32.385" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">
                <span begin="02:29.956" end="02:31.141">Until </span>
                <span begin="02:31.141" end="02:31.402">you're </span>
                <span begin="02:31.402" end="02:32.385">gone</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">直到你离我而去</span>
