                <span begin="03:13.760" end="03:14.904">so </span>
                <span begin="03:14.904" end="03:15.474">trust </span>
                <span begin="03:15.474" end="03:15.736">in </span>
                <span begin="03:15.736" end="03:16.176">me</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">尽管这是一段漫长的旅程 但请相信我</span>
